PE 875: Quad power / 四次幂

=== Fourth Powers ===
  a⁴ for a ≤ floor((10000)^(1/4)):
  1⁴ = 1
  2⁴ = 16
  3⁴ = 81
  4⁴ = 256
  5⁴ = 625
  6⁴ = 1296
  7⁴ = 2401
  8⁴ = 4096
  9⁴ = 6561
  10⁴ = 10000

=== Sums a⁴ + b⁴ ≤ N ===
  N=   100: count=   5, sum=230
  N=   500: count=   9, sum=1258
  N=  1000: count=  14, sum=4624
  N=  5000: count=  33, sum=58867
  N= 10000: count=  43, sum=129551

=== Differences |a⁴ - b⁴| ≤ N ===
  N=   100: sum(diffs) = 160
  N=   500: sum(diffs) = 830
  N=  1000: sum(diffs) = 2976
  N=  5000: sum(diffs) = 44604

=== a⁴ + b representations (unrestricted b) ===
  N=   100: sum = 11692
  N=   500: sum = 464646
  N=  1000: sum = 2270521

=== Quad-powerful numbers ≤ 10⁵ ===
  Count of quad-powerful n ≤ 100000: 57
  Sum: 1493950

=== PE Answer ===
79645946
